# Words left in a chat's field and the app left there: what 07-draft-restart (sfreplay) starts the app again over, the
# draft the core kept (composer.text) back in the field. Run just before it (its `// before it:`), so it leans on no
# other run. The chat is left before the app ends: switching to files and back confirms Home is reachable; leaving
# the chat makes the core write the draft down at once (client.focus `left`).
#env MBUI_PLATFORM=android
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =willow
tap 发消息
type 还没发出去的草稿 {T}
answered composer.text
tap icon:chevron-left
tap icon:folder
until =文件
tap icon:chats
until 端到端测试
